WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:03.177
WHETHER ARTICLES SHOULD BE

00:00:03.178 --> 00:00:04.812
REPORTED TO THE FULL HOUSE.

00:00:04.813 --> 00:00:07.248
HERE NOT TO RESPOND, CONGRESSMAN

00:00:07.249 --> 00:00:08.749
DOUG COLLINS, RANKING MEMBER OF

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:09.450
THE HOUSE JUDICIARY COMMITTEE.

00:00:09.451 --> 00:00:11.085
CONGRESSMEN, ARE YOU SATISFIED

00:00:11.086 --> 00:00:11.819
WITH THIS ARRANGEMENT?

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:12.653
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:00:12.654 --> 00:00:13.988
THIS IS A JOKE.

00:00:13.989 --> 00:00:15.556
LET'S BE HONEST WITH THIS.

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:16.957
THIS IS COVERING HER BACKSIDE,

00:00:16.958 --> 00:00:18.526
SPEAKER PELOSI SAW 50 SENATORS

00:00:18.527 --> 00:00:20.428
SAY THAT THE PROCESS IN THE

00:00:20.429 --> 00:00:21.228
HOUSE WAS BAD, THEY DIDN'T WANT

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:21.962
TO EVEN DEAL WITH IT.

00:00:21.963 --> 00:00:23.063
SHE WENT BACK TO HIM AND SHE

00:00:23.064 --> 00:00:26.400
SAID, OH, MY GOODNESS, WE

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:27.067
BELIEVE THE REPUBLICANS ARE

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:28.669
WRONG, BUT WE ARE GOING TO DO

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:29.637
WHAT THEY SAY.

00:00:29.638 --> 00:00:30.838
LOOK, SHE KNOWS EXACTLY WHAT SHE

00:00:30.839 --> 00:00:31.238
IS DOING.

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:35.943
SHE KNOWS SHE IS WRONG.

00:00:35.944 --> 00:00:39.380
HER COHORT, SCHIFF, DOWN IN THE

00:00:39.381 --> 00:00:40.548
DUNGEON, WOW FROM THE AMERICAN

00:00:40.549 --> 00:00:41.849
PEOPLE NOTICE, AND OTHER TRYING

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.885
TO COVER THEIR BACKSIDE.

00:00:44.886 --> 00:00:46.020
WITH PROPOSAL THAT IS REALLY

00:00:46.021 --> 00:00:46.420
INTERESTING.

00:00:46.421 --> 00:00:48.122
THEY ARE GOING TO GIVE THE

00:00:48.123 --> 00:00:49.190
PRESIDENT SOME ABILITY TO WEIGH

00:00:49.191 --> 00:00:51.692
IN IN THE JUDICIARY COMMITTEE,

00:00:51.693 --> 00:00:53.194
BUT NOTHING UNTIL COMMITTEE.

00:00:53.195 --> 00:00:54.195
THIS IS NOT ABOUT DUE PROCESS.

00:00:54.196 --> 00:00:56.363
AND LET ME JUST SAY SOMETHING.

00:00:56.364 --> 00:00:58.432
THIS IS NOT ABOUT RUSSIA, THIS

00:00:58.433 --> 00:00:59.433
IS NOT ABOUT A UKRAINIAN PHONE

00:00:59.434 --> 00:00:59.733
CALL.

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:01.936
THIS IS ABOUT THE FACT THAT

00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:04.572
HILLARY CLINTON WAS CRYING IN

00:01:04.573 --> 00:01:05.573
BROOKLYN, 2016, NOVEMBER.

00:01:05.574 --> 00:01:06.540
THEY HATE THE PRESIDENT BECAUSE

00:01:06.541 --> 00:01:07.408
HE HAS DONE WELL AND HE HAS DONE

00:01:07.409 --> 00:01:08.943
WHAT HE SAID HE WAS GOING TO DO.

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:10.544
LET'S GET THIS OUT IN THE OPEN,

00:01:10.545 --> 00:01:12.746
THAT'S ALL IT IS.

00:01:12.747 --> 00:01:14.014
&gt;&gt; Laura: SCHIFF HAS HAD A

00:01:14.015 --> 00:01:15.816
CONFLICT OF INTEREST FROM DAY

00:01:15.817 --> 00:01:16.584
ONE, HE HAD INITIAL CONTACT WITH

00:01:16.585 --> 00:01:17.451
THE WHISTLE-BLOWER THAT WAS NOT

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:19.753
REVEALED IN ANY OTHER LEGAL

00:01:19.754 --> 00:01:20.187
PROCEEDING.

00:01:20.188 --> 00:01:21.822
HE WOULD'VE HAD TO RECUSE

00:01:21.823 --> 00:01:23.023
HIMSELF AFTER FAILING TO

00:01:23.024 --> 00:01:23.691
DISCLOSE THAT INTEL, PRESSED

00:01:23.692 --> 00:01:26.427
ON THAT.

00:01:26.428 --> 00:01:27.928
&gt;&gt; THINK ABOUT WHAT HE DID STOP

00:01:27.929 --> 00:01:28.629
TODAY ABOUT THE GENTLEMAN ON

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:29.997
ANSWERING THE QUESTION.

00:01:29.998 --> 00:01:31.031
WHO ELSE DID HE TALK TO?

00:01:31.032 --> 00:01:33.267
HE STOPPED THAT QUESTION.

00:01:33.268 --> 00:01:35.035
WHAT WOULD THAT HAVE LED TO?

00:01:35.036 --> 00:01:36.337
WHO DID HE TALK TO?

00:01:36.338 --> 00:01:37.972
WAS AT HIS STAFF?

00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:38.872
DID SCHIFF ACTUALLY STOP A

00:01:38.873 --> 00:01:39.907
QUESTION FROM BEING ANSWERED ON

00:01:39.908 --> 00:01:41.075
WHO HE ACTUALLY GAVE THE

00:01:41.076 --> 00:01:42.810
INFORMATION TO?

00:01:42.811 --> 00:01:44.111
WHICH, IN ADDITION TO WHAT

00:01:44.112 --> 00:01:45.779
CONGRESSMAN JORDAN WAS TALKING

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:46.480
ABOUT ABOUT LEAKING CLASSIFIED

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:47.214
INFORMATION, WOULD IT HAVE LED

00:01:47.215 --> 00:01:48.882
TO, TO HAVE ADAM SCHIFF LEAD

00:01:48.883 --> 00:01:51.752
THIS KIND OF STAR CHAMBER

00:01:51.753 --> 00:01:52.853
INQUIRY WITH NO OVERSIGHT,

00:01:52.854 --> 00:01:53.687
NOTHING GOING ON, ONLY

00:01:53.688 --> 00:01:55.022
LEAKING WHAT THEY WANT.

00:01:55.023 --> 00:01:56.757
THIS MORNING, YOU TALK ABOUT THE

00:01:56.758 --> 00:01:57.524
FACT, BOMBSHELLS, THAT WAS AN

00:01:57.525 --> 00:01:59.360
OPENING STATEMENT.

00:01:59.361 --> 00:02:03.097
IT WAS UNCROSS-EXAMINED

00:02:03.098 --> 00:02:04.398
STATEMENT.

00:02:04.399 --> 00:02:06.367
THAT IS A RESUME, THE BEST YOU

00:02:06.368 --> 00:02:07.368
CAN ON CAPITOL HILL WAS AN

00:02:07.369 --> 00:02:07.868
OPENING STATEMENT.

00:02:07.869 --> 00:02:09.069
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHAT ABOUT THE FACT,

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:10.104
A LOT OF PEOPLE WERE TALKING

00:02:10.105 --> 00:02:11.572
ABOUT THIS TODAY, WE HAVE

00:02:11.573 --> 00:02:12.606
FOREIGN POLICY PROFESSIONALS,

00:02:12.607 --> 00:02:14.575
SOME WHO ARE ACTIVE DUTY

00:02:14.576 --> 00:02:15.976
MILITARY, SERVING OUR COUNTRY

00:02:15.977 --> 00:02:18.045
PROUDLY, LIKE VINDMAN, BUT

00:02:18.046 --> 00:02:18.646
NEVERTHELESS, MIGHT HAVE

00:02:18.647 --> 00:02:19.480
DIFFERENT WORLDVIEWS THAN THE

00:02:19.481 --> 00:02:21.348
PRESIDENT ON UKRAINE OR VARIOUS

00:02:21.349 --> 00:02:22.516
ISSUES.

00:02:22.517 --> 00:02:23.183
BUT IN "THE NEW YORK TIMES"

00:02:23.184 --> 00:02:25.552
PIECE YESTERDAY, IT STATED HE

00:02:25.553 --> 00:02:27.588
HAS HAD CONVERSATIONS WITH

00:02:27.589 --> 00:02:28.789
UKRAINIAN OFFICIALS WHO WERE

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:29.990
TRYING TO SOLICIT HIS ADVICE ON

00:02:29.991 --> 00:02:32.293
HOW TO WORK AROUND GIULIANI, AND

00:02:32.294 --> 00:02:33.894
TYPICALLY THOSE CONVERSATIONS

00:02:33.895 --> 00:02:36.830
WERE IN ENGLISH.

00:02:36.831 --> 00:02:37.398
NOW, WHAT ABOUT THAT?

00:02:37.399 --> 00:02:42.269
I MEAN, THEIR STATUTES, 18 USC

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:43.537
794 INVENTED REFERENCE GATHERING

00:02:43.538 --> 00:02:44.605
OR DELIVERING DEFENSE

00:02:44.606 --> 00:02:45.205
INFORMATION TO A FOREIGN

00:02:45.206 --> 00:02:46.340
GOVERNMENT, AND IT COULD BE

00:02:46.341 --> 00:02:47.541
IMPLICATED HERE, MIGHT NOT BE

00:02:47.542 --> 00:02:48.976
IMPLICATED HERE, BUT THAT IS

00:02:48.977 --> 00:02:50.811
KIND OF A WILD THING, RIGHT?

00:02:50.812 --> 00:02:51.545
I MEAN, YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO BE

00:02:51.546 --> 00:02:53.647
WORKING WITH THE COMMANDER IN

00:02:53.648 --> 00:02:53.947
CHIEF.

00:02:53.948 --> 00:02:57.051
THAT'S A PROBLEM.

00:02:57.052 --> 00:02:59.086
&gt;&gt; LET'S GO BACK TO THE OPENING

00:02:59.087 --> 00:02:59.453
STATEMENT.

00:02:59.454 --> 00:03:00.521
HE'S LAYING OUT HIS BEST CASE,

00:03:00.522 --> 00:03:02.389
BUT HE GETS INTO THE FACT, HIS

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:05.225
CONCERN ABOUT THE CALL WAS HE

00:03:05.226 --> 00:03:06.093
HAD SOME CONCERNS ABOUT THE

00:03:06.094 --> 00:03:07.394
INFORMATION IN THE CALL, BUT HE

00:03:07.395 --> 00:03:09.730
SAID THIS COULD HURT US,

00:03:09.731 --> 00:03:10.898
POLITICALLY, DOWN THE LINE.

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:13.967
SINCE WHEN IS THAT BECOMING --

00:03:13.968 --> 00:03:15.235
&gt;&gt; Laura: AND ACTIVE DUTY

00:03:15.236 --> 00:03:16.503
SERVICE MEMBER IS SUPPOSED TO BE

00:03:16.504 --> 00:03:18.339
POLITICALLY CONCERNED, YES OR

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:18.605
NO?

00:03:18.606 --> 00:03:23.143
SPEAK I DON'T REMEMBER -- WHEN I

00:03:23.144 --> 00:03:23.844
HEARD THE POLITICAL CONCERN,

00:03:23.845 --> 00:03:25.746
THAT JOB AS A POLICY.

00:03:25.747 --> 00:03:27.648
YOU ARE TO BE THE EXPERT IN THE

00:03:27.649 --> 00:03:28.816
ROOM, SO TO SPEAK.

00:03:28.817 --> 00:03:30.017
BUT WHEN HE SAID IT WAS

00:03:30.018 --> 00:03:30.751
POLITICALLY CONCERNED, THIS IS

00:03:30.752 --> 00:03:32.519
WHAT IS HAPPENING.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:33.954
ADAM SCHIFF IS GIVING LEAKS, AND

00:03:33.955 --> 00:03:34.888
WHAT IS AMAZING TO ME IS HE SAID

00:03:34.889 --> 00:03:38.525
HE DIDN'T WANT TO ERASE THE

00:03:38.526 --> 00:03:39.560
TRANSCRIPT, DIDN'T WANT THEM

00:03:39.561 --> 00:03:40.761
OPEN SO THE WITNESSES COULD

00:03:40.762 --> 00:03:41.161
COORDINATE.

00:03:41.162 --> 00:03:44.331
WE ARE ALREADY SEEING SPECIFIC

00:03:44.332 --> 00:03:44.665
LEAKS --

00:03:44.666 --> 00:03:45.532
&gt;&gt; Laura: THE LANGUAGE BEING

00:03:45.533 --> 00:03:45.899
REPEATED.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.935
&gt;&gt; SO LET'S GET OVER THIS RIGHT

00:03:47.936 --> 00:03:48.202
NOW.

00:03:48.203 --> 00:03:49.670
&gt;&gt; Laura: YOU AGREE WITH MAMA

00:03:49.671 --> 00:03:50.003
SENATE?

00:03:50.004 --> 00:03:51.405
THIS HAS TO BE SHUT DOWN, IT'S

00:03:51.406 --> 00:03:51.805
RIDICULOUS.

00:03:51.806 --> 00:03:55.008
&gt;&gt; I THINK THAT IS WHAT THEY'RE

00:03:55.009 --> 00:03:55.409
LOOKING AT.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.444
SPEAKER PELOSI KEEPS THIS

00:03:57.445 --> 00:04:00.814
RESOLUTION, SHE IS JUST BEING --

00:04:00.815 --> 00:04:03.117
&gt;&gt; EVERYTHING IS TOO LITTLE, TOO

00:04:03.118 --> 00:04:04.518
LATE.

00:04:04.519 --> 00:04:05.753
WE DON'T NEED ANY WHITE HOUSE

00:04:05.754 --> 00:04:07.154
STAFFERS TAKE ON THE CALL.

00:04:07.155 --> 00:04:08.789
OH, THERE WAS A WORD THAT WE

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.224
WANT TO PUT IN.

00:04:10.225 --> 00:04:10.991
WE HAVE A TRANSCRIPT.

00:04:10.992 --> 00:04:12.960
WE DON'T NEED YOUR OPINION,

00:04:12.961 --> 00:04:14.361
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

00:04:14.362 --> 00:04:15.195
YOU ARE APPARENTLY TESTIFYING

00:04:15.196 --> 00:04:16.096
AGAINST THE ADMINISTRATION FOR

00:04:16.097 --> 00:04:16.997
WHOM YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO BE

00:04:16.998 --> 00:04:18.265
WORKING, BUT WE DON'T NEED YOUR

00:04:18.266 --> 00:04:24.938
OPINION, WE HAVE THE TRANSCRIPT.

00:04:24.939 --> 00:04:25.639
THAT'S WHAT IS GOVERNING HERE,

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:25.973
CORRECT?

00:04:25.974 --> 00:04:26.707
THERE'S NOTHING IN THE TRASK IF

00:04:26.708 --> 00:04:27.241
THAT IS IMPEACHABLE.

00:04:27.242 --> 00:04:27.775
&gt;&gt; THERE IS NOT.

00:04:27.776 --> 00:04:34.215
NOTICE WHAT YOU HEAR SCHIFF TALK

